omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D_9uJITnVksQ7kNvwGe0io6&_nc_oc=AdqU-NulfNnZVYBG1XjN_ame7n7ydxMVEmVMVDOMGlmNMGh3fbdhv7Kc8P62O95DMuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMSVv2-XBBT5GUQNnbYdsPrXm-zUvisiErPRqM-jcSzbA&oe=6AC51234"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GC5noq2-5B0Q7kNvwEu5urJ&_nc_oc=AdpAm6_ayB1_3fBBBUQUyANx-Ab4IjjShi4c6a610dU7Zb9Sma1iNKPGB7K7CXfxbyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOszj3g8eNZBXXO3MsWn-rBkIkbkfG0Maa-ClFqyd5AqA&oe=6AC51396"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fNO-moWklHYQ7kNvwEhGmZP&_nc_oc=Adqt0K3tPmBr3qdgshK9BSyJyzNn-Wf672wwl9HSM2kyQQKrDiCeqWL6iWbAVGkuehA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPwNsiMvaQqZM61l1QAigiCn0WOgpHM6ufY2Of-FLaWkQ&oe=6AC528B7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://